WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:04.480
"December"

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.480
So you're really leaving?

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.760
Yeah.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:10.720
Where will you go?

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.650
Don't know yet.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:13.720
When will you be back?

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.030
Don't know that, either.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.160
I see. I'll have to wait for you again, huh?

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.850
Then make sure you come back stronger.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.000
I will.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.690
I'll be back.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:09.920
"Touken Ranbu Hanamaru S2"

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.700
Good morning, Master.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.650
It's unusual for you to come down.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.310
I'm counting on you today, too.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:34.090
"This anime is about the
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.140
of a certain group of
Sword Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.180
Everyone gather!

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:52.190
Good morning, gentlemen!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.110
Good morning!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.400
Do you know what today is?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.480
New Year's Eve!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.860
That's right. A day to end the year.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.820
Which is why I will say--

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:09.200
we Sword Warriors were manifested
through the power of our master, the <i>saniwa</i>,

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.420
artifact spirits who have
been granted physical bodies.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:16.090
We exist to protect time
from the History Retrograde Army

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:19.870
led by the Historical Revisionists, but--

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.510
You lot have recently been too relaxed!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.090
Especially you over there!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.270
Kuniyuki!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:30.810
Nothing good will come of
always being on your guard, either.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.900
There is a need to relax occasionally, as well.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.520
Hasebe, would you like some tea, too?

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.190
You guys are also always too relaxed!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:43.780
Listen! We don't know when
Master will give us dispatch orders!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:46.530
And we must always be completely ready

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:49.700
for that order to come anytime, anyplace--

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.370
Were you listening, you lot?!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.210
Now, now, Hasebe-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:57.130
You have more to say today, don't you?

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.050
That's right.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:03.130
You were told to clean your rooms a
few days ago. Make sure you finish that today.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.680
Okay!

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:10.520
Those who are free should clean the
common areas, like the kitchen and baths.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.740
Of course, I will be responsible for Master's room,

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:15.950
as it is my duty to take care of them.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:16.980
That is all.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.900
Are you all right?

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.740
Th-That scared me.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:27.990
There really is a lot of stuff in here, though.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.350
Excuse me!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:37.460
I am Konnosuke, newly assigned to this citadel.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:43.420
Listen, you must do your work
properly even if I am not around.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.220
Don't forget to take out the trash!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.850
Thank you for your hard work.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.470
Oh, so you've come.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.390
K-Konnosukes get replaced?

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.230
It is not common,

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:00.280
but this is a special case where this
Konnosuke was assigned to a different post,

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.400
and I have come as his successor.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:07.240
We are all working mythological foxes...

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.950
"Assignment"

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.200
...and we will go west or east,
as we are appointed.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.410
So that's how it was?

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.370
I constantly attended Master while I was here,

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.170
but this one likes to talk
to a lot of different people,

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.630
so please be friendly.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.840
I like fried tofu!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.630
I like it stewed, fried, or sandwiched.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.760
Pleased to make your acquaintance!

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.910
Pleased to make your acquaintance!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.890
Yamanbagiri-<i>san</i>.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.840
Is Master here?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.230
All right, I'm done.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.900
Kashuu-<i>san</i>, are you
finished cleaning your room?

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:47.530
I finished a long time ago.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:52.740
Mutsunokami-<i>san</i> wants some help,
so he asked people to come to the reception hall.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:53.540
Got it.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.830
I'll go once I put this away.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.980
Okay, I'll go first then.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.540
"Yasusada - Clothes"

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:11.850
That's good!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.470
What are you doing?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.270
Oh, I was waiting for you!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.940
I wanted to organize the pictures I've taken,

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:22.150
but there are so many
that I need everyone's help.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.480
Well, what're you doing taking even more then?

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.440
When I looked at the pictures,
it made me want to take more...

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.910
Jeez.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:36.500
You are the first sword to come
to this citadel, Kashuu Kiyomitsu, right?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.870
Konnosuke? Isn't he
a little different than usual?

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:44.460
Oh, right. Apparently,
this Konnosuke was newly appointed here.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.380
I have been assigned
to this citadel as of today.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.090
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.270
The pleasure's mine.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:54.470
But man, there really are a ton.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.390
But this work is fun.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.690
Looking at them like this reminds me
of everything that happened this year.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:04.110
This citadel has gotten quite lively.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:07.990
Yeah.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:12.360
I wonder what kind of journey
Yamatonokami-<i>san</i> is on right around now?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:16.320
Who knows? I'm sure
he's doing well wherever he is.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.370
I hope he returns soon.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.920
Ichi-<i>nii</i>, look at these.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.630
They're pictures of when
we all went to the beach together.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.550
You all look like you're having fun.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:30.380
Master made these swimsuits for us.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.010
Pictures are good things.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.180
They allow me to know about things
that happened before I manifested.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.930
Yeah, yeah!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:42.020
I'm gonna take tons of
pictures from now on, too!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:48.110
I'll be happy if I can make many memories
with my younger brothers from now on.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:52.780
All right, after we finish this,
I'd like to do something else with everyone.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.450
What do you guys think will be good?

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.830
How about celebrating the new year?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.540
The new year? Like humans do?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:05.460
Yeah. We might be gods of swords,
but we've been given physical bodies.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:09.460
Like humans, we can make <i>mochi</i>,
or draw fortunes.

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:11.220
Well? Sounds fun, doesn't it?

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.300
Great idea!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.550
Sounds like fun!

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:17.050
All right! Now that we've decided,
we need to get ready!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:17.810
Big Bro!

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.020
Oh? There are a lot of people here.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.180
You can't just walk around without permission--

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.480
Newbies?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.980
"48 - Tachi, Higekiri"

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.230
Hey. I'm a treasure of
the Minamoto Clan, Higekiri.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.190
That's my younger brother, um...

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.820
Please remember my name, Big Bro!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:36.240
"49 - Tachi, Hizamaru"

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.450
I am also a treasure of
the Minamoto clan, Hizamaru.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:40.290
What, you can't remember
your little brother's name?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.660
I'm not much concerned
about things like names...

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.170
It's not that we do not get along.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.760
We are tachi from the Heian period.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.260
When being tested on a criminal,
my brother cut even the man's beard,

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.430
so he was called Higekiri, or "beard cutter."

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:58.210
I cut both knees,
so I became Hizamaru, or "both knees."

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:03.740
However, we have also killed <i>ayakashi</i>
and had our names changed by our wielders,

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:07.330
so we have had numerous names until now.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.570
What name do you go by now again?

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.480
I am Hizamaru, Big Bro!

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.280
Hi-za-ma-ru!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.450
Hey!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.660
Are you new Sword Warriors?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:22.160
I was the sword of my old man,
Minamoto no Yorimasa! I'm Shishiou!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.410
Oh, wielded by the
legendary man who felled a <i>nue</i>.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.000
I'm glad to meet swords
from the Minamoto clan!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.060
Didn't I tell you not to go off on your own?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.670
Kashuu, may I have a moment?

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:33.840
What is it?

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.260
It's an order from Master--

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.930
From now on,

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.600
they will leave the care of all new Sword
Warriors who come to this citadel to you.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.810
What? To me?

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:49.650
Well, I'll leave it to you then.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.430
All right.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.860
Oh, Aoe-<i>san</i>.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.950
Ishikirimaru-<i>san</i>, what is it?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.700
Apparently, we will all be
celebrating the new year together.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.030
I was asked to say a prayer.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.830
Oh? As expected of a sacred sword.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.240
This time, it'll just be for fun, though.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:11.920
Seems like fun.
Do your best to your heart's content.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.800
Would you like to do it with me?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.130
Sounds interesting.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.550
But I am a sword that killed
a child, even if it was a ghost.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.640
Even if it's just for fun, it would
be better for you, a sacred sword,

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.720
to perform it by yourself, don't you think?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.650
"Excellent Luck"

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.080
"Fortune"

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.220
Up ahead is--

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.630
Kashuu-<i>san</i>! Are you all right?

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.600
I'm fine. I wasn't paying attention
to what was ahead of me.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:05.220
Is something the matter?

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:11.810
Actually, I asked Aoe-<i>san</i> if he would do
the new year's prayer with me earlier,

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.190
but he refused.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.740
In the past, when Master had
a fever and couldn't get out of bed,

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.990
I performed a purification ritual, but...

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.950
Have you finished the purification?

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.530
Yes, it went smoothly.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:28.120
If only I could perform
purification rituals, too.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.330
Then, I could be of help in times like this.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:33.500
There's a right job for everyone.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.970
I wonder why I cannot become a divine sword...

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:41.180
Perhaps because you killed a child?
Even if it was a ghost.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.590
That must be it, huh?

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.550
Just kidding.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.880
It might be different again
in a few hundred years.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.020
I thought that perhaps I hurt his feelings.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.060
I see.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:55.770
But you know,

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:59.220
I've lived in this citadel for a long time.

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:02.400
Nikkari has that part of him
that's not honest with himself, right?

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:06.530
So maybe if you ask him again,
he'll change his mind.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:10.630
You're right. I'll try asking again.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.040
Then, let's try asking now.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.220
Big Bro?!

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.960
That again?

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:20.460
It's been bothering me since we spoke
about becoming a divine sword.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.970
I felt bad thinking I might
have your feelings back then.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.490
That's why I invited you,
thinking we could do something together.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.600
But you know...

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.020
Is it really something to worry so much about?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.810
Well, I've been a sword for a thousand years,

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.900
so I don't care much
about most things anymore.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.030
I have also killed people and ghosts.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.920
Since you've got the chance,
why don't you do it?

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:47.450
If you're all telling me to,
I suppose I have no choice.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.240
But even if I were to do it,
I don't have the proper clothes.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.210
I can't do it in these clothes, can I?

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.540
We have a kimono you can wear.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.000
Huh?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:58.700
It's not the right color,
but we have Yasusada's.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.440
If we just leave it in the closet,
it'll get moldy.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.510
We've got to air it out once in a while.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.080
I will wear it with thanks.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.560
Yup, that's not bad.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.060
It looks good.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:23.610
I'm not one to talk, but was it really all right
to borrow Yamatonokami-<i>san</i>'s kimono?

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:26.550
It's not everyday we have
a festival, and he's not here.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.410
So I thought at least
his clothes could participate.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:35.290
You really are the one who's
been at this citadel longest, huh.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.700
You always think about everyone
and are very reliable.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:44.120
Then, shall I have you teach
me everything in detail?

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.050
About the prayer ritual, that is.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.020
Of course.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.850
Kashuu.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:52.890
Dispatch orders.

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.600
Gather in front of the space-time gate.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:02.320
Hey! Dispatch orders right
after manifesting, huh?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.360
Well, I'll be counting on you.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.860
Is that a <i>yokai</i> on your shoulder?

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.570
I don't care if it's a
demon or a sword. I'll kill it.

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:12.030
Be careful, Big Bro!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.410
You might get bitten.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:17.970
You won't! Unlike the <i>nue</i>
my old man defeated, this one's nice.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.010
He's my partner.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.500
Is that right?

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.630
I'm sure you have already heard,

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.510
but we received word that the
History Retrograde Army has appeared.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:30.010
They didn't have to show up
at the end of the year...

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.260
It can't be helped.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:35.310
Your destination is the year 1221, Sunomata.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.680
The Joukyuu War, huh?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.060
That's right.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:41.060
The war started by Emperor Go-Toba
to subjugate Houjou Yoshitoki,

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.740
the regent of the Kamakura shogunate, but lost.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:51.120
Those being dispatched are these six swords:
Kashuu Kiyomitsu, Akashi Kuniyuki,

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.110
"Sa"

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:55.200
Hotarumaru, Higekiri, Hizamaru, and Shishiou.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.120
The captain is Hizamaru.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.080
Wait a minute!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.620
Is it all right to disregard Big Bro
and have me be the leader?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:05.630
Oh my, I wouldn't kill my little brother
just because I wasn't made captain.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.510
B-Big Bro, that's not what I meant...

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.040
Let me continue.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.970
We can assume the enemy is trying
to attack and weaken the shogunate's army

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:17.430
and make Houjou Yoshitoki lose the war.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.600
I've been to Sunomata a number of times.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.560
Those from the History Retrograde Army
who appear there are pretty tough.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.400
Be careful.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.480
Also, Higekiri, Hizamaru--

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:26.990
These are from Master.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.860
"Sword Protection"

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:29.990
No one else gets them?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.740
'Cause there are only two.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.700
Besides, I have my own!

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:41.720
Then, shall we be on our way?

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:47.630
"Genji Era - Year 1 - Kyoto - June - 5th" "Transport"

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.210
What is this?

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.630
When we are dispatched,
we use this to be sent to various eras.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:51.930
We can't touch it unless
we get orders from Master.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:52.970
I understand.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.090
Understood.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:57.260
Also, do you have your portable
space-time transportation device?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.560
You mean this?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.390
Yeah.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:03.230
You can't return to the citadel without it,

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.230
so make sure you don't break it.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.730
"Joukyuu Era"

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:07.730
All set.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:10.280
Okay everyone, do your best.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.490
Good luck.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.700
"Transport"

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:23.620
"1221 - Sunomata"

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.420
The Minamotos also started
as an imperial family.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:33.840
How did they end up fighting the Imperial Court?

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.100
Even though you say that, Big Bro,

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.470
there was infighting among the
Minamoto clan, too, so it's not hard to imagine.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:43.850
It's hard to figure out how to deal with it
as a treasured sword of the family, huh?

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:48.320
In the first place, this is a branch
of the family, and completely different--

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:51.110
Oh, I don't really have
any interest in those details.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.490
Let's just get going. Long live Minamoto!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.820
Big Bro...!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.830
More importantly, Hizamaru,
did you find the enemy?

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.280
Y-Yeah.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.750
Inside the forest, huh? How shall we attack?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.510
How about... with a pincer attack?

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.100
You guys are full of openings!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.190
In a battle of life and death,

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.990
I can't just say I don't feel like it, huh?

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.320
Carelessness is the greatest enemy.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.720
I won't let you escape.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.720
Big Bro!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.190
As expected of you, Big Bro.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.480
That was amazing teamwork!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.740
Kashuu and the others are chasing the last one.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:15.570
But there are too many trees, so it looks
like they're having a hard time finding it.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.570
--Big Bro!
--Higekiri!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:21.750
Hizamaru!

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:33.250
Shoot... I messed up, huh...

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.840
Big... Bro...

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.550
But there's no way...

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.260
...I'd lose in a place like this!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.060
Damn it...

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.220
Move.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:46.980
If I've been beaten this badly,

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.730
I can't say I don't care about anything!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:54.610
If I lose, it'll make Big Bro look bad, too!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.260
Are you all right?

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:04.700
You've been beaten pretty badly.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.370
Yeah, no problem.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.670
We're fine.

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:14.550
But it was just what you'd expect from brothers!
They were perfectly in sync!

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:18.300
Even though you don't remember your little
brother's name at all. It's strange, isn't it?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:19.720
You're too kind.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.930
Big Bro! He's not praising you.

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:24.260
It's like you and Yamatonokami, huh?

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:27.270
Stop that. I'm not in sync
with that guy or anything.

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.280
Smells good.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.520
I'll bring this over to
Iwatooshi and the others--

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.660
"Goby"

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.660
Hey, what are you doing?

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:45.700
What?

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.750
For new year's soup, it's gotta be white miso!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:49.790
No, you've gotta have goby.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.790
White miso with round mochi is more elegant.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.670
Soy sauce with rectangular mochi is.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.000
It appears I am incompatible with you!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.230
And I with you.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.150
Now, now. We'll make a
white miso version later, too.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.140
Sayo-<i>chan</i>, which do you like better?

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.840
Me? I...

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:13.230
I think they both sound good.
I'd like to try both.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:15.840
Sayo-<i>chan</i>, you're so mature.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.990
Oh, you two look great!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.240
Thanks.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.200
Mutsunokami-<i>san</i>, what is that?

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:30.160
This? This thing's called a "video camera"!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.290
It can record moving pictures.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.830
Come on, try moving.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.540
Where did you get that?

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.760
When I went to the general
store to buy some saké,

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:44.640
I found it and bought it without thinking.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:53.020
I'll use this to record everything
that goes on in the citadel.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.900
That sounds like fun.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.880
Right? Right?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.160
May I join you?

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:12.840
Mikazuki...

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.710
Are you lonely without Yamatonokami?

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:22.100
Not really. It's just gone back
to how it was before he came.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:26.930
I guess there's less rivalry, is all.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:34.890
Yamatonokami will see many things
during his travels and return stronger.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:39.890
However, there are surely things that
can make you stronger because you are here.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:45.240
People with many different histories
and backgrounds are gathered here.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:49.700
By interacting with them
and getting to know them,

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:53.510
you will gain experience
you could not gain alone.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:58.380
Gaining experience leads to self-reflection.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:04.240
By knowing oneself, a new path may open up.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:08.210
You can't lose to Yamatonokami.

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:10.160
You're right.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:16.050
Now, I will also go celebrate
the new year with everyone.

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:21.230
I have to become strong, too.

00:23:54.950 --> 00:24:01.500
"Happy New Year"
"Banzai! --Hizamaru" "Minamoto --Higekiri"
"More <i>Hanamaru</i> Next Week!!"
